<http://data.silknow.org/object/adf47603-a1ba-3bb5-8f5e-b47d6c8ff7bd/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "The interior of a Roman hairdresser with two young women relaxing on a bench, one looking at herself in a mirror as the other rests her mirror on the cushion. At left, a third woman enters, unveils and prepares to place a marigold at the shrine on the black marble table. A crowd outside is glimpsed through an arched opening. The print is based on a painting exhibited at the Royal Academy now at the New Orleans Museum of Art."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/adf47603-a1ba-3bb5-8f5e-b47d6c8ff7bd> .

